Recommends: gdm3 | lightdm
Description: EiraOS local-first desktop core and Calm Command session
 EiraOS is a local-first Ubuntu desktop overlay. This package installs the
 Unix-socket daemons, AppArmor confinement, hardened systemd units and the
 Tauri-based Calm Command desktop session.
